My metro stops at a big station.
This is a junction station.
It is very crowded here.
I get off the train.
Now I need to get to another line.
I look up.
There are boards of many colors there.
I need to get to the blue line.
I see the blue boards.
I walk in that direction.
I walk in a long corridor.
People in Mumbai walk very fast.
I also walk quickly.
I reach the new platform.
I stand behind the yellow line.
In a short while, the new metro arrives.
The train doors open.
Some people alight from the train.
Then, I board my new train.
